{"sections":[{"slug":"(拟)凝聚层范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"(拟)凝聚层范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“(<span lang=\"zh\">拟</span>)<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“(拟)凝聚层范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">为了研究</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层的导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层的导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">我们需要考虑一串范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf {Coh}(X)\\subset \\mathsf {Qcoh} \\subset \\mathsf {Sh}(X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们想要将凝聚层替换为内射对象</span>, $\\mathsf {Coh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中几乎没有内射对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所以我们需要考虑更大的范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">至少</span> $X$ Noether <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, $\\mathsf {Qcoh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">有足够多内射对象</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}